    - Add golang-github-wk8-go-ordered-map-dev to Build-Depends and Depends.
    - Replace obsolete golang-gopkg-yaml.v2-dev with
      golang-gopkg-yaml.v3-dev.
    - Drop obsolete golang-github-anacrolix-log-dev.
  * Disable backends with dependencies not yet updated/available in Debian:
    - backend/dropbox: disabled because it requires
      golang-github-dropbox-dropbox-sdk-go-unofficial-dev (>= 6.4.0) with
      ContextClient support (Debian currently has 6.0.5).
    - backend/mega: disabled because it requires
      golang-github-t3rm1n4l-go-mega-dev updated to commit c6acd6a5bd04 or
      newer for LoginWithKeys and session export APIs.
    - backend/compress: disabled due to unpackaged zstd-seekable-format-go.
    - backend/archive, backend/filen, backend/internxt, backend/protondrive,
      cmd/archive, cmd/serve/nfs, cmd/serve/s3: disabled due to unpackaged
      dependencies.
    - dropbox and mega backends, drop unused log in dlna
  * debian/rules: expand DH_GOLANG_EXCLUDES to include all disabled backends.
  * d/changelog, d/watch, d/copyright: drop +dfsg suffix for 1.75.2-1
  * d/rules, d/changelog: fix lintian warnings for nproc, changelog line
    length, and privacy breaches
  * debian/patches: amend FTP patch to drop cmd/all import, renumber and
    DEP-3 hygiene
  * d/control, d/changelog: replace obsolete yaml.v2 with yaml.v3, drop
    anacrolix-log
  * debian/patches: consolidate and fold backend/dlna patches via gbp pq
  * debian/control: upgrade debhelper-compat to 14

