    - fixes getcwd() failures. Closes: #968320.
  * adds new Build-Depends:
    - golang-github-aalpar-deheap-dev (>= 0.0~git20200318.9a0c288)
    - golang-github-coreos-go-semver-dev (>= 0.3.0)
    - golang-github-hanwen-go-fuse-dev (>= 2.0.3)
